    <entry>
        <title>Charm City Day 2</title>
        <author>
            <name>Mark Williams</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://nevershiftdown.com/charm-day-2.html"/>
        <id>https://nevershiftdown.com/charm-day-2.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/11/DAY2HOLESHOT_4.2.2.jpg" medium="image" />
            <category term="CX"/>

        <updated>2025-11-15T09:15:59-05:00</updated>
            <summary>
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/11/DAY2HOLESHOT_4.2.2.jpg" alt="" />
                    Back to back race days at Charm City! It rained overnight, but nowhere near as much as expected. Some slick corners for the early morning 4/5 race, but not the mudfest I hoped for. Got a front row starting spot after some noshows and had one of the best laps of my life off the front, trying to hold a steady pace instead of blowing myself up. Finished 13th!
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/11/DAY2HOLESHOT_4.2.2.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p>Back to back race days at Charm City! It rained overnight, but nowhere near as much as expected. Some slick corners for the early morning 4/5 race, but not the mudfest I hoped for. Got a front row starting spot after some noshows and had one of the best laps of my life off the front, trying to hold a steady pace instead of blowing myself up. Finished 13th!</p>
<figure class="post__video"><iframe loading="lazy" width="560" height="314" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/AMKFsaNAGZw" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-mce-fragment="1"></iframe></figure>
            ]]>
        </content>
    </entry>
